20261014-1\",\"attempt\":\"7fd7986d-05d7-4bf5-b0bf-f5490cd402c0\",\"session\":\"471f8eb8-5f7d-4c1d-a137-52ce08f2ecf3\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/t80f-qyz3m9ti/source/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/q76-6jhvfjy9/c-yzinomdj/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261014-1' '--attempt' '7fd7986d-05d7-4bf5-b0bf-f5490cd402c0' '--session' '471f8eb8-5f7d-4c1d-a137-52ce08f2ecf3' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-14T18:25:05.464Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"7fd7986d-05d7-4bf5-b0bf-f5490cd402c0","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt_id":"7fd7986d-05d7-4bf5-b0bf-f5490cd402c0","session_id":"471f8eb8-5f7d-4c1d-a137-52ce08f2ecf3","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"6a025f50-ea66-403b-b707-576590584ebe","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"71677280-dae7-45b6-8738-3512bc7a33ff","thread":"6a025f50-ea66-403b-b707-576590584ebe","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-71677280-dae7-45b6-8738-3512bc7a33ff"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-6jhvfjy9/c-yzinomdj/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261014-1-a1","base_commit":"02f9695a4b4ce17221e37a7fe98dcc8c967e1805","card_snapshot_id":"8ecde945-74f8-49da-b938-2edc62d96ab3","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261014-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"se